          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-the-question\">1. The Question</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The people who would use this are planning on buying a home in Middlesex of around $700,000 who want to keep their property tax bill under $8,000. What do their options look like (short list of towns) to determine feasibility and whether it makes sense to pivot.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "mRmU",
