            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The only section where I changed the agent's output was section 6 when we were checking the results. The output of the formula I wanted to use to verify was: The average home value times the tax rate divided by 1,000 should come out close to the average bill. Tax rates are quoted per $1,000 of value. However, when the code resulted in just the columns calulcated bill and reported bill and then the difference, I asked the agent to also include the average value and tax rate we had previously calulated. This way we can use as a summary/ verification of our results.</span></span>"
